        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandi khou rianra mei guai hei",
            "Theithu tingsaeng gaipui ram khou",
            "Kamei nzian loumei hukhou",
            "Apoubaomei le bam chamni.",
            "",
            "Naidat lak khe ntammei hei,",
            "Lung rianra mikdui keimei hei",
            "Kanlou meipu Jisu ruina",
            "Thut phui lou ni tuna sa e.",
            "",
            "2. Poubaomei rui kasiam lou mei",
            "Neilamei namdai gaimei khou",
            "Tingsaeng ringsuangmei kandi khou",
            "Tingsaeng neihlaa suang bam puni.",
            "",
            "3. Neilana tingkao mei guai le",
            "Kanlou mei guai kariu puni;",
            "Tingsaeng neila mei la pukhou",
            "Ntam pui lat sapu lakhe.",
            "",
            "4. Zaula, pou Jisu zei paanrui",
            "Lung nimei ai neilapui ram;",
            "Tingkao lauziu natei bam e,",
            "Ringmei kachaek namdai khou tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
